        "overviewText": "Short on time but big on experiences? This **5 Days Dubai Highlights Tour Package** gives you the best of Dubai and Abu Dhabi in one perfectly balanced itinerary.\n\nCruise along the Dubai Marina, capture sweeping views from the **[Burj Khalifa](https://indiatour.live/attractions/burj-khalifa)**, and venture into the **Arabian desert** for an evening of thrills and cultural shows. You’ll also spend a day exploring the architectural beauty of **Abu Dhabi’s [Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque](https://indiatour.live/attractions/abu-dhabi-sheikh-zayed-grand-mosque)** — a sight that stays with you long after you return.\n\nThis trip is designed for travelers who want to **see the highlights without feeling rushed**. From private transfers to comfortable stays and 24x7 support — everything is taken care of so you can simply enjoy the magic of Dubai.\n\n### **Dubai Highlights Overview**\n### \n**Tour Type:** Private Tour\n\n**Destinations Covered:** Dubai & Abu Dhabi\n\n**Starting Point:** Dubai International Airport (DXB)\n\n**Ending Point:** Dubai International Airport (DXB)\n\n### **Why Choose This Dubai Highlights Package**\n### \n- Covers **Dubai and Abu Dhabi’s top attractions** in just 5 days\n- Includes **Burj Khalifa, Desert Safari, Dhow Cruise & City Tours**\n- **Private transfers and flexible timing** for maximum comfort\n- Ideal for **first-time travelers, couples, and families**\n- Balanced mix of **sightseeing, culture, and leisure time**\n- Managed by **trusted on-ground partners** with 24x7 support\n\n*(Want a more relaxed pace? Check out our [6 Days Dubai Travel Package](https://indiatour.live/tours/dubai-travel-package) for a longer stay.)*\n\n\n### **Dubai Trip Highlights**\n### \n- **Dhow Marina Cruise with Dinner** – sail through Dubai’s glittering skyline\n- **Dubai City Tour** – discover Jumeirah Mosque, Atlantis The Palm & more\n- **Burj Khalifa (124th & 125th Floors)** – panoramic views from the world’s tallest building\n- **[Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner](https://indiatour.live/attractions/desert-safari-dubai)** – dune bashing, camel rides & live performances\n- **Abu Dhabi City Tour** – visit Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque & Corniche\n- **24x7 travel support** throughout your stay\n\n### **Who Is This Dubai Trip For**\n### \nThis **5 Days Dubai Highlights Package** is ideal for:\n\n- **Families** – who want a fun, easy, and memorable short break\n- **Couples** – seeking romantic moments and luxury city experiences\n- **First-time travelers** – looking to cover Dubai and Abu Dhabi in one go\n- **Small groups or senior travelers** – preferring private, well-organized tours\n\n*(Planning a special getaway? Explore our [Dubai Packages](https://indiatour.live/dubai) now.)*\n\n\n### **Good to Know Before You Go Dubai**\n### \n- **Best time to visit:** November to March for pleasant weather\n- **Dress modestly** when visiting religious or cultural sites\n- **Evening desert tours** can get cool — carry a light jacket\n- **Credit cards** are widely accepted; keep some **cash** for local markets\n- Fridays are **weekend prayer days** in the UAE — plan major visits accordingly\n\n#### **Booking & Support**\n#### \nAt India Tour Experiences, every tour is coordinated with **licensed local operators** to ensure safety, comfort, and personalized care. Enjoy **verified drivers, prompt airport pickups**, and **24x7 support** throughout your [Dubai holiday.](https://indiatour.live/tours/dubai-with-lapita-resort)\n\n **Enquire Now** to customize your **5 Days Dubai Highlights Tour** — and discover the perfect mix of luxury, culture, and adventure.",
