        "overviewText": "Short, sweet, and spectacular — this **4 Days Discover Dubai Tour** packs the city’s top experiences into a quick getaway.\n\nCruise through Dubai Marina as the skyline lights up, admire the world from the **[Burj Khalifa’s 124th floor](https://indiatour.live/attractions/burj-khalifa)**, and feel the thrill of the **Desert Safari** under a golden sunset.\n\nFrom modern marvels to desert adventures, this package is the perfect mix of **culture, comfort, and excitement**. Whether it’s your first time in Dubai or a short vacation break, every day brings a new highlight.\n\n### **Discover Dubai Trip Overview**\n### \n**Duration:** 4 Days / 3 Nights\n\n**Tour Type:** Private Tour\n\n**Destinations Covered:** Dubai\n\n**Starting Point:** Dubai International Airport (DXB)\n\n**Ending Point:** Dubai International Airport (DXB)\n\n### **Why Choose This Discover Dubai Package**\n### \n- Covers **Dubai’s best attractions** in just 4 days\n- Includes **[Dhow Cruise](https://indiatour.live/attractions/dhow-marina-cruise-with-dinner), Desert Safari, City Tour & Burj Khalifa**\n- **Private transfers and curated experiences** for total comfort\n- Ideal for **first-time visitors, couples, and short stays**\n- Supported by **24x7 assistance** for a smooth travel experience\n\n*(Want to explore Abu Dhabi too? Check out our [5 Days Dubai Highlights Package](https://indiatour.live/tours/dubai-highlights).)*\n\n\n### **Discover Dubai Trip Highlights**\n### \n- **Dhow Marina Cruise with Dinner** – enjoy dinner on Dubai’s glittering waters\n- **Dubai City Tour** – visit iconic landmarks like Jumeirah Mosque & Atlantis The Palm\n- **Burj Khalifa (124th & 125th Floors)** – breathtaking city views from the top\n- **[Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner](https://indiatour.live/attractions/desert-safari-dubai)** – dune bashing, belly dancing & cultural performances\n- **Convenient airport transfers and on-ground assistance** throughout your stay\n\n### **Who Is This Discover Dubai Trip For**\n### \nThis **Discover Dubai Tour Package** is perfect for:\n\n- **Couples** – planning a romantic short break\n- **First-time travelers** – looking to experience Dubai’s must-sees\n- **Families** – wanting a quick yet fulfilling vacation\n- **Solo travelers** – seeking an easy, well-organized itinerary\n\n### **Good to Know Before You Go Dubai**\n### \n- **Best time to visit:** November to March for pleasant temperatures\n- **Dress comfortably** for the desert and carry sunscreen & sunglasses\n- The **Dhow Cruise** is best enjoyed in the evening — dress smart casual\n- **ATMs and cards** are widely accepted; small cash is handy for souks\n- Fridays are **prayer days**, so attractions may open later than usual\n\n#### **Booking & Support**\n#### \nEvery India Tour Experiences tour is coordinated with **licensed local partners** for safety, comfort, and reliability. Enjoy **airport pickups, verified guides, and 24x7 support** so your Dubai holiday stays smooth from start to finish.\n\n**[Enquire Now](https://indiatour.live/tours/dubai-highlights)** to book your **4 Days Discover Dubai Package** — and explore the city where desert dunes meet futuristic dreams.",
