      "overviewText": "If you’ve ever imagined watching sunsets over desert dunes, gazing at city lights from the world’s tallest tower, or standing before a mosque made of marble — this trip brings it all together.\n\nThis isn’t a checklist-style tour. It’s a **well-paced [Dubai and Abu Dhabi holiday](https://indiatour.live/dubai)** that gives you the time to breathe in every moment — from dinner under the stars on a dhow to a quiet afternoon inside the [Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque](https://indiatour.live/attractions/abu-dhabi-sheikh-zayed-grand-mosque).\n\nExpect **private transfers, smooth logistics, and curated experiences** that blend leisure and exploration. Whether you want to chase the skyline, explore local souks, or simply relax by the beach — this 7-day journey is designed to flow at your pace.\n\n### **Dubai Tour Package Overview**\n### \n**Duration:** 7 Days / 6 Nights\n\n**Tour Type:** Private Tour\n\n**Destinations Covered:** Dubai & Abu Dhabi\n\n**Starting Point:** Dubai International Airport (DXB)\n\n**Ending Point:** Dubai International Airport (DXB)\n\n### **Why Choose This Dubai Tour Package**\n### \n- Covers both **Dubai and [Abu Dhabi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/abu-dhabi-city-tour)’s top attractions** in one seamless trip\n- Includes **Burj Khalifa, [Desert Safari](https://indiatour.live/attractions/desert-safari-dubai), Dhow Cruise, and Global Village**\n- **Private transfers & flexible pacing** – explore comfortably\n- Ideal for **couples, families, and first-time travelers**\n- Balanced mix of **sightseeing, leisure, and cultural immersion**\n- Operated by **trusted local partners** with 24x7 support\n\n*(Looking for something shorter? Explore our [5 Days Dubai Highlights Packages](https://indiatour.live/tours/dubai-highlights) for a quick getaway.)*\n\n### **Dubai Tour Package Highlights**\n### \n- **Dhow Marina Cruise with Dinner** – sail past Dubai’s glittering skyline\n- **Dubai City Tour** – discover Jumeirah Mosque, Atlantis The Palm & more\n- **Burj Khalifa (124th & 125th Floors)** – enjoy breathtaking views of the city\n- **Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner** – dune bashing, camel rides & live shows\n- **Abu Dhabi City Tour** – marvel at Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque & Corniche\n- **The View at The Palm (52nd Floor)** & Monorail Ride\n- **[Global Village Dubai](https://indiatour.live/attractions/global-village)** – a cultural, shopping & entertainment extravaganza\n- **24x7 support** and **private vehicle transfers** throughout\n\n### **Who Is This Dubai Tour Package For**\n### \nThis **7-Day Dubai Tour with Abu Dhabi City Tour** is ideal for:\n\n- **Families** – looking for comfort, safety, and variety in activities\n- **Couples** – seeking romantic experiences and city views\n- **First-time travelers** – who want to see both cities without hassle\n- **Senior travelers & small groups** – preferring privacy and relaxed schedules\n\n*(Planning a special occasion? Check out our [Dubai Page](https://indiatour.live/tours/best-of-dubai) for tailor-made escapes.)*\n\n### **Good to Know Before You Go Dubai**\n### \n- **Best time to visit:** November to March for pleasant weather\n- **Dress modestly** when visiting religious or cultural sites\n- **Desert evenings** can be cool – carry a light jacket\n- UAE is **card-friendly**, but small cash helps in souks and taxis\n- **Global Village** operates seasonally (October to April)\n\n#### **Booking & Support**\n#### \nAll India Tour Experiences’ tours are organized in collaboration with **licensed, reliable on-ground partners**. From **airport pickup to your final drop**, every detail is taken care of — including verified drivers, prompt assistance, and 24x7 traveler support.\n\nReady to plan your Dubai escape?\n\n**Enquire Now** and our travel experts will help customize your ideal **[Dubai & Abu Dhabi holiday](https://indiatour.live/dubai)**.",
