      "overviewText": "If you’ve ever wanted to explore Dubai’s landmarks **and** enjoy a resort-style theme park escape — this package brings you the best of both worlds.\n\nStart your journey in **Dubai**, where you’ll cruise along the glittering Marina, watch the city unfold from the **[Burj Khalifa](https://indiatour.live/attractions/burj-khalifa)**, and go dune bashing across the desert sands. Discover the cultural beauty of **Abu Dhabi**, including the stunning Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque.\n\nThen unwind with a stay at the **Lapita Resort**, part of Dubai Parks and Resorts — where Polynesian charm meets adventure. Enjoy **free access to any one park** (Motiongate, Bollywood Parks, or Legoland) and spend the day your way — thrilling rides, water slides, or pure relaxation.\n\nIt’s a mix of **urban discovery, desert adventure, and resort indulgence** — perfect for travelers who want a little of everything.\n\n### **Dubai with Lapita Resort Trip Overview**\n### \n**Duration:** 6 Days / 5 Nights\n\n**Tour Type:** Private Tour\n\n**Destinations Covered:** Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Lapita Resort\n\n**Starting Point:** Dubai International Airport (DXB)\n\n**Ending Point:** Abu Dhabi International Airport (AUH)\n\n### **Why Choose This Dubai with Lapita Resort Package**\n### \n- Includes **stay at Lapita Resort** with **free theme park access**\n- Covers **[Dubai and Abu Dhabi highlights](https://indiatour.live/tours/dubai-highlights)** in one trip\n- Perfect mix of **sightseeing and leisure** experiences\n- **Private transfers** for seamless comfort\n- Great for **families, couples, and first-time UAE travelers**\n\n### **Dubai with Lapita Resort Trip Highlights**\n### \n- **[Dhow Marina Cruise with Dinner](https://indiatour.live/attractions/dhow-marina-cruise-with-dinner)** – sail past Dubai’s skyline at sunset\n- **Dubai City Tour** – explore Jumeirah Mosque, Atlantis The Palm & more\n- **Burj Khalifa (124th & 125th Floors)** – breathtaking city views\n- **[Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner](https://indiatour.live/attractions/desert-safari-dubai)** – dune bashing, cultural shows & food\n- **Abu Dhabi City Tour** – visit Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque & Corniche\n- **Lapita Resort Stay** – Polynesian-themed retreat with resort facilities\n- **Free Access to 1 Park** – choose from Motiongate, Bollywood Parks, or Legoland\n- **24x7 on-ground support**\n\n### **Who Is This Dubai with Lapita Resort Trip For**\n### \nThis trip is designed for:\n\n- **Families** – with kids who’ll love the Lapita Resort experience\n- **Couples** – who want adventure and relaxation in one trip\n- **Theme park lovers** – with access to world-class entertainment\n- **Travelers seeking variety** – desert, culture, city, and resort vibes\n\n### **Good to Know Before You Go Dubai**\n### \n- **Best time to visit:** November to March\n- **Lapita Resort** is part of Dubai Parks and Resorts – includes access to multiple theme parks\n- Choose **any one park** (Motiongate, Bollywood Parks, or Legoland) with free entry\n- Carry **comfortable footwear** for long walks in parks and desert\n- **[Global Village](https://indiatour.live/attractions/global-village) & theme parks** operate seasonally (October–April)\n\n#### **Booking & Support**\n#### \nAll experiences are curated by **India Tour Experiences** with verified hotel stays, licensed guides, and on-ground coordination. Enjoy a **hassle-free journey** with round-the-clock support, personalized service, and flexible customization options.\n\n**Enquire Now** to book your **[Dubai with Lapita Resort Package](https://indiatour.live/dubai)** — where the thrill of theme parks meets the serenity of a luxury resort stay.",
