      "overviewText": "From sky-high views to desert adventures and futuristic art spaces — this 7-day **Dubai and Abu Dhabi Tour** is your complete UAE experience.\n\nCruise through Dubai Marina under the city lights, stand atop the **Burj Khalifa**, explore the mind-bending worlds at **AYA Universe**, and soak in views from **[The View at the Palm](https://indiatour.live/attractions/the-view-at-the-palm)**. Wander through the floral wonderland of **[Miracle Garden](https://indiatour.live/attractions/dubai-miracle-garden)** and the cultural buzz of **[Global Village](https://indiatour.live/attractions/global-village)**.\n\nEnd your journey in **Abu Dhabi**, home to the elegant **Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque** and the thrilling **Ferrari World**, where speed and adrenaline meet Italian flair.\n\nThis itinerary blends **modern icons, cultural charm, and world-class leisure** — designed for travelers who want to see it all without rush.\n\n### **Dubai Tour Package with Abu Dhabi Trip Overview**\n### \n**Duration:** 7 Days / 6 Nights\n\n**Tour Type:** Private Tour\n\n**Destinations Covered:** Dubai & Abu Dhabi\n\n**Starting Point:** Dubai International Airport (DXB)\n\n**Ending Point:** Abu Dhabi International Airport (AUH)\n\n### **Why Choose This Dubai Tour Package with Abu Dhabi**\n### \n- Covers **Dubai & Abu Dhabi** in one well-paced trip\n- Includes **[Burj Khalifa](https://indiatour.live/attractions/burj-khalifa), AYA Universe, The View at the Palm & Ferrari World**\n- Mix of **adventure, culture, and family-friendly attractions**\n- **Private transfers** for comfort and flexibility\n- Ideal for **families, couples & first-time UAE visitors**\n\n### **Dubai Tour Package with Abu Dhabi Trip Highlights**\n### \n- **Dhow Marina Cruise with Dinner** – glide past Dubai’s illuminated skyline\n- **Dubai City Tour** – explore Jumeirah Mosque, Atlantis The Palm & more\n- **Burj Khalifa (124th & 125th Floors)** – stunning city views\n- **[Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner](https://indiatour.live/attractions/desert-safari-dubai)** – dune bashing, camel rides & live shows\n- **AYA Universe Dubai** – immersive digital art experience\n- **The View at the Palm & Monorail Ride** – see Dubai’s iconic island from above\n- **Miracle Garden & Global Village** – floral displays & global markets\n- **Abu Dhabi City Tour & [Ferrari World Entry](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ferrari-world-yas-island-abu-dhabi)** – Grand Mosque and adrenaline thrills\n- **24×7 on-ground support**\n\n\n### **Who Is This Dubai Tour Package with Abu Dhabi For**\n### \n- **Families** wanting fun, culture & relaxation in one trip\n- **Couples** looking for romantic yet adventurous experiences\n- **First-timers** who want a complete Dubai + Abu Dhabi holiday\n- **Adventure seekers** excited about Desert Safari and Ferrari World\n\n### **Good to Know Before You Go Dubai**\n### \n- **Best time to visit:** November to March (pleasant weather)\n- **Ferrari World** is closed on some Mondays — check schedule before visit\n- **AYA Universe & Global Village** require moderate walking — wear comfortable shoes\n- **Global Village & Miracle Garden** operate seasonally (October to April)\n- Carry a **light jacket** for evening desert temperatures\n\n#### **Booking & Support**\n#### \nEvery trip with **India Tour Experiences** is crafted for comfort and trust — with verified hotels, licensed drivers, and dedicated assistance. Expect **seamless transfers, custom options, and 24×7 on-ground support** throughout your stay.\n\n **Enquire Now** to book your **7 Days Dubai & Abu Dhabi Tour Package with Ferrari World Tickets** — the ultimate UAE experience for families and couples alike.",
